<div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 motion-rise">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none">Projects</h1>
    <p class="text-base font-light text-base-content/60 max-w-lg motion-fade motion-delay-1">
      Products I have shipped recently, from game experiments to practical tools
      that solve everyday problems.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col">
    <hr class="border-base-content/10" />

    <article class="py-10 border-b border-base-content/10 motion-rise motion-delay-1">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-6 sm:gap-10">
        <span class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-base-content/15 leading-none select-none shrink-0 w-12 sm:w-16">01</span>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">My Bus Assistant</h2>
              <p class="text-base text-base-content/60 max-w-prose">
                A fast Singapore bus-arrival web app with real-time data, smart search,
                favorites, nearby stops, and offline-friendly caching.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex sm:flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-2 shrink-0 sm:text-right">
              <a
                href="https://my-bus-assistant.minggliangg.com/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-sm text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-200 no-underline"
              >
                Live App ↗
              </a>
              <a
                href="https://github.com/minggliangg/my-bus-assistant"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-sm text-base-content/50 hover:text-base-content hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-200 no-underline"
              >
                GitHub ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">React 19</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Hono</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Bun</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Turborepo</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Tailwind CSS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="py-10 border-b border-base-content/10 motion-rise motion-delay-2">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-6 sm:gap-10">
        <span class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-base-content/15 leading-none select-none shrink-0 w-12 sm:w-16">02</span>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">React Breakthrough</h2>
              <p class="text-base text-base-content/60 max-w-prose">
                A digital version of the abstract strategy game Breakthrough with
                drag-and-drop gameplay, board customization, themes, and responsive UX.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex sm:flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-2 shrink-0 sm:text-right">
