              >
                GitHub ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">React 19</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Vite</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/40 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Tailwind CSS</span>
